A column-0 line after a description-hosted note is a document sibling

```
:: t
:  [^f]: note
     - nested
tail
.
<dl>
  <dt>t</dt>
  <dd></dd>
</dl>
<p>tail</p>
```

```
:: t
:  [^f]: note
     cont
tail
.
<dl>
  <dt>t</dt>
  <dd></dd>
</dl>
<p>tail</p>
```

```
:: t
:  [^f]: note
     - nested
   tail
.
<dl>
  <dt>t</dt>
  <dd></dd>
</dl>
```

```
:: t
:  [^f]: note
    - nested
tail
.
